{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12110330","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12110330","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1211033001:1":{"text":"メモの通りなら、魔像は浪と漂流の神がわざとここに置いてったんだな。","source_cn":"按照笔记上的说法，魔偶好像是风浪与漂泊之神故意留在这里的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F84F33A36FCAEC8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1211033002:1":{"text":"どうりで魔像にしては凶暴性が低いと思いました。恐らく不良品を拾ってきたのでしょうね。","source_cn":"这里的魔偶大多攻击性不强，可能是那位神明捡来的残次品吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAAF430540D76398A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1211033003:1":{"text":"漂流の神は暴力を好まないのでしょうか？神々の戦いは、すべての神を巻き込んだ大乱戦だったというのに……これは新発見ですね。","source_cn":"风浪神似乎不喜杀戮，这是个新发现。毕竟在诸神之战时期，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF0D1101E98B1E51E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1211033004:1":{"text":"それよりも、あの石野郎を倒したってのに、どこにも鍵がねぇじゃねぇか。","source_cn":"比起那些，我们明明已经击败了那个石头疙瘩，为什么还没有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x162D31145BFE7565","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1211033005:1":{"text":"鍵とは言っても、小さな石の欠片ですから、どこかに埋まっているのかもしれません。辺りを探してみましょう！","source_cn":"虽然叫钥匙，但只是一个小石块，可能埋在废墟里了，我们找找吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD19CEC8F230E5624","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","